&lt;li&gt;1-3 years of backend engineering experience in a production environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong programming skills—Go preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid grasp of distributed system design, API architecture, and event-driven workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background working with databases (e.g. Postgres) and scalable data systems (e.g. Kafka, Redis)&lt;/li&gt;
