&lt;p&gt;The Channel Sales team is looking for a proven sales leader to take the reins of our channel engine and scale our footprint across EMEA. We’ve built a high-performing organization of both Channel Sales Managers and L1s. Your job is to help us put down the right processes, expand the team, put together the right strategy, and be hands-on with our key partners to help us 5x the business over the next 3 years. We’re seeking an entrepreneurial, results-driven leader who excels at coaching teams, building executive partner relationships, and delivering above-quota results in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead a team of EMEA Channel Sales Managers (CSMs) directly and a UK L1 in achieving individual and team quota&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continue expanding the team by hiring 9s and 10s and retaining the existing team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support &amp;amp; coach team of CSMs in their responsibility to build pipeline daily&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with our direct sales team and marketing teams to build our go-to-market strategy for EMEA and translate that into our EMEA channel strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reporting on CSM activity and forecast to the VP of Global Channel Sales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage daily and weekly activities, pipelines, forecasts and closed deals to ensure above-quota results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate and lead weekly and monthly one-on-one and team-wide pipeline reviews, meetings and training&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive and own exec relationships at our key channel partners and help drive growth within these key partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure for our strategic partners, we have clear business plans and hold internal stakeholders and the partners accountable for delivery against the plan&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success in directly leading a high-performing channel team&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Channel management experience with Security Integrators and/or IT VAR reseller partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated sales success (President’s Club or similar recognition)in a high-volume transaction sales environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent presentation and listening skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to successfully hire and train new CSMs and coach lower performers through to success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to accurately forecast sales results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;50% travel expectation throughout your assigned territory&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
