&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Policy &amp;amp; Procurement Experience: &lt;/strong&gt;Direct experience shaping policy or procurement outcomes in favor of a company or product, not just monitoring or tracking legislation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Industry Background: &lt;/strong&gt;A background in enterprise technology or SaaS selling into government — cloud, cybersecurity, or platform software strongly preferred. A physical security industry background is explicitly not required, as we are prioritizing government relationship depth and technology sales fluency over category-specific product knowledge, which we will teach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sector Range: &lt;/strong&gt;Experience in both Federal and SLED markets, or a clear, credible plan for how you&#39;d build the side you know less well.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Building: &lt;/strong&gt;A demonstrated ability to build and lead a team, so prior people-management and hiring experience is essential, not optional.&lt;/li&gt;
