&lt;p&gt;You can look at all kinds of communities to see our platform’s impact in the world. It&#39;s the retailer that uses our agentic AI to deter theft before it happens. The warehouse that uses AI-powered alerts to make sure its team is protected on the floor with proper PPE. The school that’s alerted to a threat in real-time and triggers a lockdown in seconds, not minutes. We’re rapidly scaling this impact: today, more than 2 million Verkada devices are deployed across 170+ countries.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;About the Role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Physical AI only goes as far as power and the internet can reach. Verkada&#39;s Connectivity products push that boundary, securing people and property in remote and edge environments. Our team brings Verkada&#39;s AI threat detection, deterrence, and operational insights anywhere you need them, allowing our cameras and other security solutions to be deployed in locations without existing internet or power.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Lead Product Manager to own Verkada&#39;s edge products: the Gateway product line and the hardware/software platform behind our Security Trailers. Your mission is to bring network + power to any device, anywhere, and make edge products the backbone of physical AI beyond the building.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are committed to a thriving in-office culture. This role requires you to work onsite at our HQ in San Mateo, CA.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own strategy and execution for Verkada&#39;s Cellular and Wi-Fi Gateway product line and trailer platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grow and expand the gateway portfolio including advanced reliability options, fleet-scale cloud management, and new form factors that provide edge connectivity and power&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver the trailer platform&#39;s core promise: continuous off-grid uptime with zero site infrastructure. Push solar, battery, and cellular intelligence until the trailer runs itself. Then, expand the platform into new form factors and use cases!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with product lines across Verkada (remote cameras, security trailers, transportation, intercoms, access) to deliver connectivity-as-a-service and drive ecosystem attach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define data plan and pricing strategy that provides easy, fast, affordable data to our customers&lt;/li&gt;
