&lt;li&gt;2+ years relevant work experience in Sales Enablement, Training or broader Sales roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Very organized and detail oriented&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Great communication skills and able to command the room&lt;/li&gt;
