&lt;p&gt;You can look at all kinds of communities to see our platform’s impact in the world. It&#39;s the retailer that uses our agentic AI to deter theft before it happens. The warehouse that uses AI-powered alerts to make sure its team is protected on the floor with proper PPE. The school that’s alerted to a threat in real-time and triggers a lockdown in seconds, not minutes. We’re rapidly scaling this impact: today, more than 2 million Verkada devices are deployed across 170+ countries.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Sales Recruiter based in our London office, you will partner closely with our Sales Leadership team to identify, attract, and hire talented sales professionals to join our world-class organization. Recognized as one of the fastest growing companies in Silicon Valley - our London office is scaling quickly! Having opened 5 new countries across EMEA last year alone, we’re looking for a driven individual to lead our continued growth across new markets. This role will play an essential part in driving our ambitious growth plans and will play a key role in scaling our sales teams across the region.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the full recruiting cycle from source to close for sales roles across Mid-Market, Enterprise &amp;amp; Leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategically and creatively source passive sales candidates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with our Sales teams to generate candidate referrals.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop relationships with Sales leadership to collaborate during the hiring process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make compelling presentations to all candidates about Verkada and the Sales Organization.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide top notch candidate experience while acting as a trusted internal business partner to our stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with your RC to manage the interview scheduling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track and document candidate communications in ATS - Greenhouse.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan and execute sales recruiting events, some travel required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4-6 years of successful full-cycle recruiting experience: from source to close. Agency and internal experience is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of closing top tier sales talent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in supporting and hiring for Mid-Market and Enterprise sales organisations required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in other languages is a plus, but not a requirement.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ability to influence using collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to navigate and flourish in a fast-paced, start-up environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing multiple internal competing priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commitment to excellence and top performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to travel to host events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using Greenhouse, LinkedIn Recruiter or familiar with wider ATS systems&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
