&lt;p&gt;As a member of our Sales Strategy and Operations team, you will have an integral role in driving the insights, operations, and strategy that enables Sales to run better, faster, and smarter. Sales Strategy and Operations is an excellent platform to learn how a business really runs.&amp;nbsp; Prior candidates that our leadership team has worked with have gone on to be VPs and COOs of companies.&lt;/p&gt;
