&lt;li&gt;Develop large scale systems to interact with and configure products remotely&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and improve low-latency, high-throughput, high-reliability microservice architectures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and develop features incorporating cutting edge computer vision&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design clean APIs and implement them using Python and/or Go&lt;/li&gt;
