&lt;li&gt;Experience building &lt;strong&gt;embedded Linux UIs&lt;/strong&gt;, such as for infotainment systems or other device interfaces (e.g., Qt or similar frameworks)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to &lt;strong&gt;hardware-integrated products&lt;/strong&gt; or &lt;strong&gt;IoT systems&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
