&lt;p&gt;Join the fastest-growing frontier in our AI for the physical world portfolio: &lt;strong&gt;Intelligent Intercom Systems&lt;/strong&gt;. The Intercom product line is a critical component of our intelligent building ecosystem, delivering &lt;strong&gt;rich, low-latency, multimodal interactions&lt;/strong&gt; (video, audio, and access control integration) directly at the environment’s edge. This is a &quot;startup within a startup&quot; opportunity where you will have significant ownership over the architectural direction of this burgeoning product line, which is already the most successful launch in Verkada history. We have ambitious plans to disrupt&amp;nbsp; , including &lt;strong&gt;AI-driven visitor screening and remote environmental sensing&lt;/strong&gt;. You will work alongside firmware, mobile, and frontend experts to drive this core element of our physical security layer.&lt;/p&gt;
