&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employee Lifecycle Management: &lt;/strong&gt;Oversee the end-to-end employee journey with an emphasis on efficiency, employee experience, and automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;People Analytics: &lt;/strong&gt;Design and deliver meaningful workforce analytics to measure the impact of People programs and inform organizational health, workforce planning, and executive decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits and compensation:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead benefit programs globally and partner with our head of compensation to scale compensation infrastructure.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compliance &amp;amp; Risk Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Ensure People processes comply with all local labor laws, internal policies and various audit standards.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with leadership across Legal, Finance, Security, IT and other departments to align people programs with broader business goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process &amp;amp; Policy Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Establish and maintain scalable People policies, SOPs, and workflows that align with business goals and operational standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
