&lt;p&gt;We are actively looking for an experienced front-end engineer to join our Web Platform team. As a vital member of the team, you will be the architect, designer, and developer across a broad range of high-impact projects. You will act as a force multiplier, partnering closely with &lt;strong&gt;8+ product teams&lt;/strong&gt; to help build and scale a robust web-based platform that supports a suite of connected devices for enterprise customers at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will go beyond building features; you will be instrumental in modernizing a massive codebase through &lt;strong&gt;microfrontend re-architecture&lt;/strong&gt; and pioneering &lt;strong&gt;AI enablement&lt;/strong&gt; across all of web engineering.&lt;/p&gt;
