&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Empower product engineering:&lt;/strong&gt; Support, collaborate with, and mentor engineers across 8+ distinct product teams, ensuring they have the platform tools needed to move fast and build great user experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive AI enablement:&lt;/strong&gt; Champion the adoption and integration of AI tools and methodologies to accelerate development and enhance the capabilities of all web engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovate the stack:&lt;/strong&gt; Continuously evaluate, select, and design the architecture using next-generation web technologies and frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own developer infrastructure:&lt;/strong&gt; Manage and optimize our &lt;strong&gt;CI/CD pipelines&lt;/strong&gt; to streamline deployments, reduce friction, and improve developer velocity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Champion testing and quality:&lt;/strong&gt; Establish, advocate for, and enforce rigorous automated testing standards and quality assurance practices across the platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strengthen platform foundations:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop shared core utilities, infrastructure libraries, and architectural patterns that enable fellow teammates to build faster, while collaborating seamlessly with our dedicated Design System team.&lt;/li&gt;
