&lt;p&gt;The Workplace Development team is responsible for designing and delivering workplace environments that enable Verkada&#39;s continued global growth. As the Senior Manager Workplace Architect, you will lead the architectural planning, space design, and technical execution of Verkada&#39;s office and lab environments from concept through construction documentation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this highly technical, hands-on role, you&#39;ll own workplace programming, test fits, architectural drawing production, and cross-functional systems coordination while establishing scalable design standards across Verkada&#39;s real estate portfolio. You&#39;ll serve as the primary architectural resource for workplace projects, partnering closely with Designers, Project Managers, consultants, contractors, and internal stakeholders to deliver high-performance, thoughtfully designed spaces that support our business and employees.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role reports to the Director of Workplace Development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
