&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of product design or mobile product design experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Polished portfolio that demonstrates strong visual and interaction design skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in design, art, human-computer interaction (HCI), or equivalent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A drive to solve complex problems with simple and elegant solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience in creative problem solving and partnering with product, engineering, and other designers to do so&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced in creating and integrating animated visuals and interactive design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in: Figma, Adobe Creative Suite (PhotoShop, After Effects, and Illustrator)&lt;/li&gt;
