&lt;li&gt;2+ years leading, mentoring, and scaling engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of software engineering experience building scalable, reliable distributed systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with real-time or high-availability systems where latency and uptime carry consequences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of driving product outcomes through close collaboration with product management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
